.TH GENEEXPRESSION 1 2000-1月 "project" "project"
.SH NAME
project \- make matrix samples column projection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIproject(\fBx\fR as <generic> Matrix, 
\fBsampleIds\fR as any);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
make matrix samples column projection
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBx\fB \fR\- a gene expression matrix object. 
.PP
.PP
\fBsampleIds\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the sample id for make the matrix column subset.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a new expression matrix object that only contains the sample columns which 
 is specified by the \fBsampleIds\fR parameter, and the sample columns in the 
 generated matrix are in the same order as the given sample id vector;
 
 NULL will be returns if the given sample id vector is nothing or is an 
 empty vector.
.PP
